  "aiConsentBody": "To write your reading, Taro sends your question, the spread and the cards you drew, and your app language to our Taro servers, which use a third-party AI service to write the interpretation. We never send your name, email or advertising ID. Your question is not stored on our servers. Your reading is kept encrypted only until your phone has received it (at most 7 days), then deleted. If you report a reading, it is kept for 90 days. The AI service does not use this data to train AI models. Readings are AI-generated and may be wrong or unexpected.",
